*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0046
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-04-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 535
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0046.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0046C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 LATE-FEE           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2000-LATE-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "LATE-FEE=" LATE-FEE
    STOP RUN.
2000-LATE-PENALTY.
    EVALUATE AC-DAYS-LATE
        *> EARLY LATE PAYMENT FEE
        WHEN 1 THRU 10
            MOVE 25 TO LATE-FEE
        *> LATE PAYMENT FEE
        WHEN 11 THRU 30
            MOVE 35 TO LATE-FEE
        *> SERIOUSLY LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
        WHEN 31 THRU 999
            COMPUTE LATE-FEE = AC-STMT-DUE-AMT * 0.08
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO LATE-FEE
    END-EVALUATE.
